{
  "_comment": "Provisioned Store apps Win11Forge can strip from the image. 'match' is a wildcard against the package DisplayName. 'remove' is the default tick in the GUI. Camera, Sound Recorder, Photos, Store, Terminal, Notepad, Paint, Calculator and Snipping Tool are kept on purpose so mic/camera/screenshots work out of the box.",
